  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_01",
      "hash64": "F78081D5B9B474EB",
      "text": "Revoilà mes chers élèves !\\nComment vous allez, aujourd’hui ?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_02",
      "hash64": "F78082D5B9B4769E",
      "text": "Malheureusement, ceci est notre dernier cours.\\nAre you ready ?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_d_07_yes_01",
      "hash64": "5BC72982841CF29E",
      "text": "Oui !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_d_07_yes_02",
      "hash64": "5BC72882841CF0EB",
      "text": "Yes !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_03",
      "hash64": "F78083D5B9B47851",
      "text": "Great answer ! Votre enthousiasme fait plaisir\\nà voir ! Ça présage un excellent dernier cours ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_04",
      "hash64": "F78084D5B9B47A04",
      "text": "Today, on va continuer à travailler notre\\ncompréhension orale.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_05",
      "hash64": "F78085D5B9B47BB7",
      "text": "Come on, Pikachu ! C’est à toi ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_d_07_poke_01",
      "hash64": "01CFB19AF1E7EB2A",
      "text": "Pikachu !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_06",
      "hash64": "F78086D5B9B47D6A",
      "text": "Vas-y, mon petit ! Pour notre dernier exercice de\\ncompréhension orale...[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_07",
      "hash64": "F78087D5B9B47F1D",
      "text": "Dis-nous comment tu te sens ! Please ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_d_07_poke_02",
      "hash64": "01CFB09AF1E7E977",
      "text": "Chuuu !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_08",
      "hash64": "F78078D5B9B465A0",
      "text": "Oh, vous avez entendu ? Ça donne envie\\nde partager ce sentiment, non ?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_09",
      "hash64": "F78079D5B9B46753",
      "text": "À votre avis, qu’est-ce qu’il essaie de nous\\ncommuniquer ?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_d_07_select_01",
      "hash64": "9CDF97736583ECF5",
      "text": "La joie.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_d_07_select_02",
      "hash64": "9CDF94736583E7DC",
      "text": "La souffrance.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_d_07_select_03",
      "hash64": "9CDF95736583E98F",
      "text": "La surprise.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_d_07_select_04",
      "hash64": "9CDF92736583E476",
      "text": "Tu peux répéter, Pikachu ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_answer_01",
      "hash64": "2EFDD0FDDC43E69C",
      "text": "Bravo, [VAR 0x0100(0000)] ! Well done !\\nC’est une grande joie pour moi aussi de t’avoir\\r\\ndans ma classe ! Ha ha ! Elle est pas mal, non ?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_answer_02",
      "hash64": "2EFDD3FDDC43EBB5",
      "text": "Comment ? Ce cri t’a vraiment donné\\nl’impression que Pikachu souffrait ?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_answer_03",
      "hash64": "2EFDD2FDDC43EA02",
      "text": "Comment ? Ce cri t’a vraiment donné\\nl’impression que Pikachu était surpris ?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_10",
      "hash64": "F78406D5B9B78CC1",
      "text": "Lorsque Pikachu s’exprime de cette façon\\net dit...[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_d_07_poke_03",
      "hash64": "01CFAF9AF1E7E7C4",
      "text": "Chuuu !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_11",
      "hash64": "F78405D5B9B78B0E",
      "text": "C’est qu’il est fou de joie !\\c\\nJe ne sais pas vous, mais moi, quand j’entends ça,\\nj’ai envie de danser ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_12",
      "hash64": "F78404D5B9B7895B",
      "text": "Pour cette fois-ci, Pikachu ne jouait pas un rôle !\\c\\nIl a simplement voulu vous dire combien il avait\\nété heureux de participer à ces cours avec vous ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 153,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_13",
      "hash64": "F78403D5B9B787A8",
      "text": "Moi aussi, d’ailleurs, je tiens à me joindre à ce\\ncher Pikachu...[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_14",
      "hash64": "F7840AD5B9B7938D",
      "text": "J’ai été très heureux de pouvoir vous rencontrer\\ntous, et d’avoir pu vous enseigner mon savoir ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_15",
      "hash64": "F78409D5B9B791DA",
      "text": "Et maintenant, il est temps pour le dernier, mais\\nnon moins salvateur, conseil de Salvio ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_16",
      "hash64": "F78408D5B9B79027",
      "text": "Vous êtes encore jeunes, et croyez-moi, vous\\nne manquerez pas de raisons d’être en colère\\r\\nou triste au quotidien. Ça vous arrivera sûrement\\r\\nplus que vous ne le voudriez, en tout cas.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 188,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_17",
      "hash64": "F78407D5B9B78E74",
      "text": "Dans la vie il y a des hauts, mais il y a aussi\\ntoujours des bas ! Comme des montagnes russes ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_18",
      "hash64": "F783FED5B9B77F29",
      "text": "Pourtant, au bout du compte, on peut tous\\nréussir à trouver le bonheur !\\c\\nLe chemin pour y arriver sera parfois pénible, mais\\nessayez de vous accrocher et de garder le sourire ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 179,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "class_d_07_poke_04",
      "hash64": "01CFAE9AF1E7E611",
      "text": "Chuuu !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_19",
      "hash64": "F783FDD5B9B77D76",
      "text": "Et quand vous avez du mal à vous en sortir, allez\\ntrouver quelqu’un sur qui vous pouvez compter.\\c\\nPeu importe que ce soit un professeur, un ami ou\\nvotre famille... L’essentiel est d’en parler.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 194,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_20",
      "hash64": "F7870CD5B9B9CCCA",
      "text": "Sur ce... Notre prochain rendez-vous sera\\nle contrôle final !\\c\\nRévisez bien, surtout, je vous fais confiance !\\nAdiós ! Bye bye ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
